{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #f2f6fa; box-sizing: border-box; color: #35465b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 26px 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #35465b; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #35465b; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 24px 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e细碎雪花在浅冰蓝天幕间悄然飘落，整篇文章像覆上一层清澈安静的冬日初雪。\u003c/p\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 38px auto 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e1eaf3; color: #35465b; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 16px; text-align: center; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e浅色系也能拥有灵动雪景\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #35465b; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e内嵌轻量循环飘雪 GIF 底纹，动效极轻极柔，保证浅灰蓝文字清爽易读、久看护眼。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background: transparent; border: 1px solid #657891; border-radius: 20px; color: #35465b; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 24px 18px; text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e下雪的日子最适合放慢脚步，把这一年的故事好好收尾。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/ink-mountains.jpg\" alt=\"薄雾笼罩的静谧远山与寒江\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 38px auto 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e1eaf3; color: #35465b; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 16px; text-align: center; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e冬日动效的独有魅力\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e浅冰蓝飘雪 GIF，全库独一份季节动效\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e适配年终总结、冬日旅拍与节气随笔\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e明暗模式均保持清透雪白观感\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #657891; color: #35465b; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e愿这个冬天，风雪之外皆是温暖。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
